# Cordova plugins for Capacitor
capacitor-cordova-ios-plugins

# Note: App/App/public, App/App/capacitor.config.json and App/App/config.xml are
# generated by `npm run sync` but are committed on purpose, so the project builds
# in Xcode straight from a fresh clone without Node.js. Re-run `npm run sync`
# after changing src/ and commit the result.
